(7618356, 1233826, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this. I like the lighting and background. But I wish you would have used some flowers or weeds that were more lacy. These read weeds, not flowers, and just seem rather bulky. 6 as is. It''s just that I think it could have been really effective, but didn''t quite make it for me.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this. I like the lighting and background. But I wish you would have used some flowers or weeds that were more lacy. These read weeds, not flowers, and just seem rather bulky. 6 as is. It''s just that I think it could have been really effective, but didn''t quite make it for me.', '2019-03-09 15:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
